    "# Colab Utils: Helper Functions and Setup\n",
    "## MIMIC-IV 30-Day Readmission Prediction - Colab Arm\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective**: Provide utility functions and setup helpers for the Colab notebook workflow.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Usage**: Run this notebook first to set up the environment and import common utilities.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features**:\n",
    "- Google Drive mounting and path setup\n",
    "- MIMIC-IV data loading utilities\n",
    "- Progress tracking and memory management\n",
    "- Visualization helpers\n",
    "- Integration with existing src/ scripts"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Environment Setup"
